## Why This Is Asked
This question probes ability to design scalable, secure, multi-tenant data pipelines on GCP, balancing isolation, cost control, and reliability in real-world enterprises.

## Key Concepts
- Pub/Sub and Dataflow streaming, exactly-once or dedup strategies
- BigQuery partitioning, per-tenant isolation with Authorized Views and row-level security
- CMEK for Cloud Storage staging, IAM least privilege
- Audit logging, monitoring, cost controls, testing strategies

## Code Example
```javascript
// Deduplication helper (conceptual)
function isDuplicate(event, seen) {
  const key = event.event_id + '|' + event.event_time;
  if (seen.has(key)) return true;
  seen.add(key);
  return false;
}
```

